[SIZE=6][B][DD] - Core Library v1.5.0[/B][/SIZE]

The essential core framework required for all [B]cv6 / Dice Dragons[/B] add-ons.

[HEADING=2]Features[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]Multi-Alphabet Index Provider Repository[/B]: Extensible multi-script alphabet registry (Latin, Greek, Cyrillic, Hebrew, Arabic) with RTL layout, variant mapping, and code event integration.
[*][B]Inline Phrase Quick-Edit[/B]: AdminCP quick-translation modal to edit phrases across all languages directly without leaving the form.
[*][B]FontAwesome Icon Auto-Completion[/B]: Interactive autocomplete dropdown ([I]fa-[/I] + 2 characters) with live SVG mask previews inheriting current text color ([I]currentColor[/I]), smooth transitions, and full modifier class support ([I]fas[/I], [I]fa-spin[/I], [I]fa-rotate-90[/I]).
[*][B]FontAwesome Icon Chooser[/B]: Pre-built template menu for FontAwesome icon selection.
[*][B]Asset Uploader[/B]: Standardized upload template with live image preview.
[*][B]Icon Helper & Validation[/B]: Backend filesystem indexing ([I]cv6\Core\Helper\Icon[/I]) and robust option verifiers ([I]verifyValidIconMandatory[/I] & [I]verifyValidIconOptional[/I]).
[/LIST]

[HEADING=2]Requirements[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*]XenForo 2.3.0+
[*]PHP 8.2.0+
[/LIST]
